<title>UK: TENNIS-SAMPRAS WINS 6-2 6-1 7-6 IN WIMBLEDON SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SAMPRAS WINS 6-2 6-1 7-6 IN WIMBLEDON SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Friday's first  men's singles semifinal (prefix denotes seeding)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v Todd Woodbridge (Australia)</p>
<p>Sampras won 6-2 6-1 7-6</p>
<p>(Play started 90 minutes late at 1340 GMT. Halted again at 1415</p>
<p>GMT. Resumed at 1510 GMT)</p>
<p>Playing later:</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) v Cedric Pioline (France)</p>
</text>
